    "name": "Amazon EC2 Amazon EC2 API API",
    "description": "Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (EC2) Query API for managing virtual\nmachines, EBS volumes, security groups, key pairs, AMIs, VPCs,\nsubnets, and related infrastructure. All operations are invoked\nby POSTing form-encoded `Action=<Name>&Version=2016-11-15` to the\nregional endpoint, signed with AWS Signature Version 4 (SigV4),\nand return XML responses.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
